      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was going to make a separate post for additional feedback, but I'm gonna dump it into here since it's already tracked and organized:\n\n-I feel like that the VRChat Homeworld should include more portals for people to find avatars. The only options for avatars that I currently see are the ones included by the mirror, as well as only one portal leading to an avatar world (100Avatars).\n\n--I'm NOT suggesting Prismic's or other avatar search worlds, because we know it's nearly impossible to control the risk of coming across an inappropriate avatar, and that's something nobody wants.\n\n---Maybe VRChat should have an expanded catalogue of curated avatar worlds, since there's not a whole lot of those. For starters, you could always include a portal to the Avatars 3.0 Hub that tupper uploaded.\n\n-Near the mirror, you should add a sign explaining Expressions and the Action Menu.\n\n-The portal for Melon & Chill appears twice; once on page 3, and another on page 4.\n\n-This area (see screenshot) looks dull and uncolorful. Make it pop out a bit more?\n\n-Add a few more pickups (at least one with physics, and one with a trigger interaction) so people can learn how to interact and throw an object with their controllers.\n\n-Try to intrigue more people to subscribe to VRChat+; there's no banners for it in the Home world.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
